WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Open V.O.I.C.E. and add it to the Home Screen.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.600
This puts V.O.I.C.E. on the iPad as its own
app with its own icon.

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.000
On the iPad, open Safari

4
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:16.600
and go to the V.O.I.C.E. link. It has to be Safari
for the next step to work.

5
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:23.600
Tap the Share button, the square with
an arrow pointing up.

6
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:30.500
Tap Add to Home Screen,

7
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.800
then tap Add.

8
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:43.000
From now on, open V.O.I.C.E. from its icon.

9
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:49.500
Once it has opened one time,
it works without the internet.

10
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:54.000
V.O.I.C.E. A free AAC app for children
who are new to AAC.
